# The deployed api Worker (ADR-0019). Not a secret: it is in every page the SPA
# serves. Without it a production build calls relative /api paths, which the
# assets-only web Worker answers with index.html.
VITE_API_URL=https://devsprint-api.eleo-666.workers.dev
# The public issues MCP server (scenario S-F), shown in the empty transcript.
VITE_MCP_URL=https://devsprint-mcp-issues.eleo-666.workers.dev/mcp
